    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατ-άγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰγ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring down along with</i> or <i>together</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620b18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				371a12
			</span></i>; <i>bring with one to port,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PHib.
				1.49.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>join in bringing back</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τύραννον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					339
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				16.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Διόνυσον</span> (at the
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καταγώγια</span>, q.v.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δῆμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.78
				</span></i>
			; from exile, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				333e
			</span></i>.</div>
